60913e19695710487b0aac9f34e317cd245c6686d97b87e13dc23ada2bebb1e6{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-107322","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-11","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926107322/tm2623653d2_8k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7.bin","sha256":"e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"materialEvents":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"f704e2c0d250eacf651d58b2edf17201bec949866e25786f4ffe8ea7fbde6d66","quote":"On September 11, 2026, XBP Global Holdings, Inc. (the “Company”) entered into securities purchase agreements (the “Purchase Agreements”) with certain accredited investors (the “Purchasers”), for the sale by the Company in a private placement (the “Private Placement”) of an aggregate of 2,275,245 shares (the “Shares”) of the Company’s common stock, par value $0.0001 per share (the “Common Stock”), at a weighted purchase price of approximately $2.66 per Share, for aggregate gross proceeds to the Company of approximately $6.05 million.","context":"Item 1.01. Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement.","section":"Item 1.01. Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement.","block":24,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-107322","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-11","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926107322/tm2623653d2_8k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7.bin","sha256":"e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7"}},{"id":"ddfe141cbb22c923863b9ebf07438fb5822e04006b4dd917bacac2392c9a20db","quote":"On September 11, 2026, in connection with the Purchase Agreements, the Company entered into Registration Rights Agreements with the Purchasers (each, a “Registration Rights Agreement” and collectively, the “Registration Rights Agreements”). The Registration Rights Agreements provide, among other things, that the Company will file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) a registration statement registering the resale of the Shares no later than September 22, 2026. The Company agreed to use commercially reasonable efforts to have such registration statement declared effective as soon as practicable after the filing thereof.","context":"The Shares issuable pursuant to the Purchase Agreements will not be registered under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the “Securities Act”), and will be issued in reliance on the exemption from registration requirements thereof provided by Section 4(a)(2) of the Securities Act or Rule 506 of Regulation D promulgated thereunder. The Company relied on these exemptions from registration based in part on representations made by the Purchasers.","section":"Item 1.01. Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement.","block":29,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-107322","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-11","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926107322/tm2623653d2_8k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7.bin","sha256":"e94cef3cb51e3181f6cd99792c41042f5abfb184548cba4af525c672afc64db7"}},{"id":"a192dd237777dae8bde6b5e9f224a38fa46dbbe6272787577483bcf56d9d0583","quote":"In connection with the Private Placement, the officers, directors and certain stockholders of the Company each executed a lock-up agreement, pursuant to which each such person agreed, without the prior written consent of Cantor and subject to certain exceptions, not to (i) directly or indirectly, offer for sale, sell, pledge or otherwise dispose of any shares of Common Stock (including shares of Common Stock that may be deemed to be beneficially owned or hereafter acquired) or securities convertible into or exercisable or exchangeable for Common Stock, (ii) enter into any swap or other derivatives transaction that transfers to another, in whole or in part, any of the economic benefits or risks of ownership of shares of Common Stock, or (iii) publicly disclose the intention to do any of the foregoing, for a period ending on the earlier of (a) the 30th day following the date on which the Company’s registration statement registering for resale the Shares issued in the Private Placement has been declared effective by the SEC or (b) the 60th day following the closing of the Private Placement.","context":"On September 11, 2026, in connection with the Purchase Agreements, the Company entered into Registration Rights Agreements with the Purchasers (each, a “Registration Rights Agreement” and collectively, the “Registration Rights Agreements”). The Registration Rights Agreements provide, among other things, that the Company will file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) a registration statement registering the resale of the Shares no later than September 22, 2026. The Company agreed to use commercially reasonable efforts to have such registration statement declared effective as soon as practicable after the filing thereof.","section":"Item 1.01. Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement.","block":30,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-107322","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-11","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Arch